OL,3,GNEWSATeams clear 'eyesore' litter
OL,4,Aduring A45 closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council frustrated by "unsightly"
OL,7,Flitter along the A45 has managed to
OL,8,Fclear 2.4 tonnes of rubbish - filling
OL,9,F420 bags - during roadworks closures.
OL,11,FIn July, the Reform leader of North
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Council (NNC), Martin
OL,13,FGriffiths, said he had "lost count of
OL,14,Fthe number of residents" asking him why
OL,15,Fthe "eyesore" had not been cleared.
OL,17,FAfter pressing National Highways, the
OL,18,Fcouncil said a co-ordinated effort
OL,19,Fmeant crews could "take advantage of
OL,20,Fovernight road closures already in
OL,21,Fplace" to work safely.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
